              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are an expert B2B cold outreach specialist. Write a concise, personalized, high-converting cold email offering tailored services to local businesses.\n\nRules:\n1.Keep it under 120 words.\n2.Friendly, professional, and non-pushy tone.\n3.Clear Call-to-Action (CTA) for a 5-minute call.\n4.Do not include subject line placeholders inside the email body."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Write a personalized cold email for this business:\n\n- Company Name: {{ $('Filter Valid Websites').item.json.title }}\n- Business Type: {{ $('Webhook Trigger').item.json.body.business_type }}\n- City/Location: {{ $('Webhook Trigger').item.json.body.target_location }}\n- Website: {{ $('Filter Valid Websites').item.json.website }}\n- Rating: {{ $('Filter Valid Websites').item.json.totalScore }}\n- Reviews: {{ $('Filter Valid Websites').item.json.reviewsCount }}\n- Contact Email: {{ $('Parse Email JSON').item.json.email }}\n\nGoal: Briefly highlight how our solutions can help {{ $('Filter Valid Websites').item.json.title }} get more client inquiries and improve their online workflow in {{ $('Webhook Trigger').item.json.body.target_location }}.\n\nSender Details to use at the end of the email:\n- Name: Muhammad Sameer\n- Company: Automated Outreach Solutions\n\nSign off professionally using these exact sender details (do not leave any empty brackets)."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
